        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#FF0000&quot;&gt;* Lambda → CloudWatch Logs arrows omitted for clarity.&lt;br&gt;* Lambda → SSM arrows omitted: Gmail connect, Reconcile and Import read the Gemini key and Google OAuth client secret from SSM.&lt;br&gt;* All Lambdas run outside the VPC; Aurora is reached only via the RDS Data API (no NAT Gateway).&lt;br&gt;* API Gateway rejects requests without the CloudFront secret origin header (read from SSM).&lt;br&gt;* Statement PDFs and their passwords never leave the browser; only parsed rows reach the API.&lt;br&gt;* Dashed = optional or configuration link. Staging: same layout in a separate account, without WAF, Gemini free tier, Cognito's default email sender and a testing-mode OAuth client.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
